                         </item>
                         <item>
                          <widget class="QToolButton" name="toolButton_8">
                           <property name="enabled">
                            <bool>true</bool>
                           </property>
                           <property name="toolTip">
                            <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;To achieve proper alignment between the laser and camera, it is necessary to introduce a strip featuring a circular aperture. Once the circular hole is positioned at the center of the field of view (FOV), accurately set the circle by utilizing the &amp;quot;Set Circle&amp;quot; button. Subsequently, you may proceed to &amp;quot;Align Laser&amp;quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;Potential issues leading to alignment failures include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;1. Presence of objects beneath the circular hole, detectable in either the camera or laser threshold image. To address this, eliminate any objects beneath to prevent interference with the camera or laser detection. If its not possible to remove the object, you can adjust the threshold so it includes the object in the threshold.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;2. &amp;quot;Set Circle&amp;quot; was not done correctly. Ensure that the region of interest (ROI) is meticulously drawn to appropriately accommodate the circular hole, thus facilitating a precise alignment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:9pt;&quot;&gt;3. Camera Z is not in focus or strip is not within laser's field of view (FOV).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                           </property>
                           <property name="styleSheet">
                            <string notr="true"/>
                           </property>
                           <property name="text">
                            <string>...</string>
                           </property>
                           <property name="icon">
                            <iconset resource="VisionApp.qrc">
                             <normaloff>:/VisionApp/Icon/24x24/letter-i.png</normaloff>:/VisionApp/Icon/24x24/letter-i.png</iconset>
                           </property>
                          </widget>
                         </item>
                        </layout>
