                                   <font>
                                    <pointsize>10</pointsize>
                                    <weight>75</weight>
                                    <bold>true</bold>
                                   </font>
                                  </property>
                                  <property name="toolTip">
                                   <string>Pixel and height scaling for this map.

When a profiler is connected these are read from it and locked. Offline - replaying a saved TIFF on a PC with no sensor - they become editable, because there is nothing to derive them from.

Selecting this section shows the raw image with no ROIs.</string>
                                  </property>
                                  <property name="styleSheet">
                                   <string notr="true">color: rgb(255, 255, 255);</string>
                                  </property>
                                  <property name="text">
                                   <string>0 - Scale</string>
