                                  <item>
                                   <widget class="QLabel" name="label_algoH2Window">
                                    <property name="toolTip">
                                     <string>How far above and below its reference plane the head can measure at all. The LJ-X8060 sees +/-7300 um about a reference distance of 64 mm, so 14.6 mm full scale.

A height outside this range cannot be a real measurement - the sensor returns grey 0 for anything it cannot reach - so a value beyond it is a stray peak or an interpolation artefact. It is here as a sanity floor and as a reference when setting the valid raw band in section 2.</string>
                                    </property>
                                    <property name="text">
                                     <string>Sensor Z range um:</string>
                                    </property>
