                                     <string>Fit quality limit. A high residual means the surface under the ROIs is not actually flat - a warped part, or an ROI overlapping a raised feature - so the plane is wrong and every height measured from it is wrong with it. Stopping here is better than reporting plausible numbers. 0 disables the check.</string>
