                                      <weight>75</weight>
                                      <bold>true</bold>
                                     </font>
                                    </property>
                                    <property name="toolTip">
                                     <string>Measures each ROI against the datum plane from section 2.

The two ranges below do different jobs. Valid decides which pixels are measured at all; Criteria decides pass or fail.

Valid must be WIDER than Criteria. If they match, a feature that is genuinely out of spec gets thrown away as invalid instead of failing - the ROI reports NO DATA and the defect ships.

Selecting this section shows the straightened part view and its height ROIs.</string>
                                    </property>
                                    <property name="styleSheet">
                                     <string notr="true">color: rgb(255, 255, 255);</string>
                                    </property>
                                    <property name="text">
